# Agent Context Rules for Al-Quran Project

## NEVER read or modify these files - they are too large for context:
- src/lib/quran-data.json
- src/lib/quran-uthmani.json
- quran_mishary.json
- quran_30p.json
- quran_page.json
- db/custom.db

## When working with Quran data:
- The uthmani JSON is imported as `uthmaniData` in page.tsx - treat it as opaque data
- Focus on the TypeScript logic, not the JSON content
- surah-data.ts, asma-ul-husna.ts, quran-paras.ts, ruku-boundaries.ts are safe to read

## Architecture:
- Single-page Next.js app with tab-based navigation
- Tabs: Asma ul Husna, Bayan ul Quran, Quran, Prayer
- Audio player uses HTML5 Audio with proxy endpoint
- Prayer times fetched via /api/prayer with geolocation
- Quran reading is para (juz) based with uthmani script
